{"title":"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the value(s) of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/2/ac2c97d45a3630a1788f2596938d5f8fa9a3d711.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8xy - 12y + 2x - 3 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"187\" height=\"17\" /> is true for all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/8/cf89b53bc48ae54f4edd7f0e2168f2e7eb966088.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } \\frac23 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } \\frac32 \\text{ or } -\\frac14 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } -\\frac23 \\text{ or } -\\frac14 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } \\frac32 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } -\\frac32 \\text{ or } -\\frac14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"599\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/2/b925f8766b1c194a1b11fdb060568eaf61fbf1f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8xy - 12y + 2x - 3 = 4y(2x - 3) + (2x - 3) = (4y + 1)(2x - 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"498\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/6/0c6047c7610085992da6227b47dfbb2dd632379d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4y + 1)(2x - 3) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"162\" height=\"18\" /> must be true for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/9/2c98dcec2f44c405acbfe4952095c1c45236cda1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x - 3 = 0$\" width=\"83\" height=\"12\" />, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/3/be390034214843564fea926776dda5b56ae8fbe5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = \\frac 32\\ \\mathrm{ (D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"93\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since we want only the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-variable to be present, we move the terms only with the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-variable to one side, thus constructing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/2/ac2c97d45a3630a1788f2596938d5f8fa9a3d711.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8xy - 12y + 2x - 3 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"187\" height=\"17\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/c/9dce4b996fbc2f8e79d144d4ce50422fdf1b9faf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8xy + 2x = 12y + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"153\" height=\"16\" />. For there to be infinite solutions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and there is no <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we simply find a value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> such that the equation is symmetrical. Therefore,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027a99f5c1ba49bc337f1960665080bd87f3c733.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 3$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/3/2433d1cf815b160dee71dec5fa5a9edc5ec1f576.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8xy = 12y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"80\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>There is only one solution, namely <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/a/66a38f9edfdd0346cb5c3ffb19432a7684aee36e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed{\\dfrac{3}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"59\" height=\"48\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/d/87d32bac8c5abe4d6b299d444f24a8055279b232.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B\">2002 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a hre